{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1484,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff3a8fb1f6b205b5d8fbf4a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうやら、走り過ぎたようだ。\r\n指が、声が、脚が――満足に\r\n動かせないんだ…休ませてほしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4edc2e840fbee10930ad4f44beaa90a97b1673335bad297763b6fbf1b0c0e1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de20ef2d67cf38411caf6c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はははっ、今日の私は比類なき\r\nソリストさ！至高のレース、\r\n夢のような音楽会に招待するよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c36baec2f7899df7aea59ba55bc12675503003f62a2a5b52885bd63bcd045a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a360bc193a43a71a0476a982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非の打ち所のない仕上がりだ。\r\n驚きと感動を響かせる、\r\n絶唱の走りを披露しよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b58ca6f25afa0d37c9cb11997eeb811175cd442a6687b6a931777b5d9b3b73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c83e5d9a4e6b9c0e3d6f1a5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "音が弾む、心が弾む！\r\nこの調子で、私の躍動する音を\r\nアニマートに響かせよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8fc3316c826ffa6d20747fe24e7eb7a9d4ee9b4b4738b1fd39546e47ffd1119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2cd8b1045eb8782a74739f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特等席から熱い視線を頼むよ。\r\n期待以上に応えられそうなんだ――\r\nお返しは、勝利の凱歌さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50a6ee0e6c8a2516ed356b21ea730c5b5b3f23baf237dd457d6dc36ff528c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc85d39e0cadb6e03b6a853",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "湧きあがるムジカへの情熱は\r\n客席へと広がり、歓喜の音で\r\n満たされるだろうさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36f84daa4c4181391b19ffe3e4b140aa4766c484f6dfe56c16aa660d196fa567",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:444cb03af9ed2f3e1863bebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と鍛えたこの脚は、最高の楽器。\r\n名曲を奏で、\r\n人々の魂を揺さぶろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e0ab814c8224d6624ba0f881b25163b3f88cfbeaa10ad3bf46cac61c762bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a3125f37bb6eb29a2f6577d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆、開演前からレースへの\r\n高揚をかき鳴らしているね。\r\nふふっ、私も負けずに奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b082d9a053f8e0564f955d39af5ae8529a24edeeda0ddbe8f614d0a0e998571a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f891e025a68f2b35b7316db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "積み重ねを、あるがままに。\r\n…そう、私たちの努力は\r\n決して裏切らないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad56706d03886f178dbf1bb5046b8bfbf1973c78258eb3f4b23a3923e6895bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b5482766f14c1307a179281",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら、緊張しないで。\r\nレースの終幕――コーダで、\r\n一緒に笑おうじゃないか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62259156c8cb88e41ee0ad949921ccb846eb777a650f8961499931561f409e2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae642aeaa8b64e940441c4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅん…調子がズレたまま本番か。\r\n他のムジチスタを窺いつつ、\r\n調律してみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273d788fb10e6778ccf5c43826e01f98618c2006f11ef524030d1726a2ae72e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64628aeb9bbd61e5f9cc30dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信じて送り出してほしい。\r\n理想の音色が出せなくても、\r\n皆の胸を打ってみせるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53eadc1e0a24970cf7283db5491aca3c33119bd2aaa9f50a47750cba495c819f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e59759e6c0c40e7eddde2a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドレミファソラシド～～…っと、\r\nやはり今日の私はこんなものか…。\r\nあとは、どうベストを尽くすかだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbc04515aca14005ca733d379a749bc723f5a8e4c98d03fd416ae55734881e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13b78c53c150c83c59047c3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不協和音になろうと、私は奏でる。\r\nレースをゆく音楽家として、\r\nそれだけは譲らないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "840ecc14a88ff3cf56840a7b08c5049471d4cfd986a9975eeb27d071aa922885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e07f3f089cb97dd31035a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メインを張るのは難しそうだ…\r\nリードは誰かに任せ、\r\n私は自分の音に集中しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "457c9c005033195e8bf13df12835b5b06f4cdc75679fed0765b7063dab46b879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcd3e9f678c39b7f7e7832a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうも周りのテンポが速そうだ。\r\n今の私で追いつけるのか…いや、\r\nアドリブでなんとかしてみせる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56fa46862174f52298cff6799d0af1345986bb6ea738ed378170b5225422cf10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20988ec6770d622bd6a9fce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スィ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b878b5b4ced66a3dd3d024ddfe88e672a3a3dfcb17bfc030e5b2ce5e9faa53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:873a466b414c57e1dbf592b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ははっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e2a5616adbc093583704d7f17cbe954b39985eb9e1414132110defdfe9051c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:161ac0ef546fbfacab79e0a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そら！",
      "source_fingerprint": "701099fe9604d59ecc3b35d187611ee55942fe64a465ae1e2884d4d24e8a1e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e383683436915316386d001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほほう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf97c91d630c473c094bc43ad372d419b9fe8b005ddace40eda6dbd7028bb90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0cbf0cd4f52fc4c2ac5ba77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まさか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9e3002d3df72172c8b171d9df824ac0d4e08e49ee7090278e66288d3795d5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae1c724c4131d25f62820625",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68e8537f616dbda0429bd29623ad2678a834bbc0865151e93c6769ee9f68bc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a753b971d4afd8427fd87b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あははっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faef35818c722995ce0ac1ef38c9a07ca7b218722f2cf83b0bf4e4faa5241b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3d53258aa7524d68702904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゆこう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99a65e7a68f257dd98cea654174a64b5d82637b0ff9a966b34f62ac91c94e06a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb719dc51b3e1b24124f8b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "グラッツィエ、アモーレ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6054ee8d3f5d0a83aedf5db735baac8c246f9560aa11326003948b4f2571d307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:306ca8df2df36e3d0171d90f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しい伴奏だったよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "127d7a35c1fb08edc0d55d9530a04eafbce15db4945a6ccb94de0f8b0110bd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c42d14f4eeeb36886c2772",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君の音色が知りたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6b69b4bac31fcac2a79b1c235be1b17ee6b8beca94ccc78d349c0cb70a01e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e51b9aa1f47a26f00dcd7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、開演だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2179619b1a4f14a12f61ea1a571f4b307400045ad7cfeecc4500fe063ba4cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acac4fe5d3ede821bbfaaf80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただ音に身を預けて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd52bda23c5fdc5a2ed4f6c980963301736386318538c0429039e58185396f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20312e8b2486acdb82cd8a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しい伴奏だったよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "127d7a35c1fb08edc0d55d9530a04eafbce15db4945a6ccb94de0f8b0110bd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48e16c5ec3fabee575e87b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と鍛えたこの脚は、最高の楽器。\r\n名曲を奏で、\r\n人々の魂を揺さぶろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e0ab814c8224d6624ba0f881b25163b3f88cfbeaa10ad3bf46cac61c762bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2433862e830dc4bc8c8aab47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "音が弾む、心が弾む！\r\nこの調子で、私の躍動する音を\r\nアニマートに響かせよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8fc3316c826ffa6d20747fe24e7eb7a9d4ee9b4b4738b1fd39546e47ffd1119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e45d9425f3fbff5956422b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しい伴奏だったよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "127d7a35c1fb08edc0d55d9530a04eafbce15db4945a6ccb94de0f8b0110bd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d4c0ac48d333f290c12bad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スィ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b878b5b4ced66a3dd3d024ddfe88e672a3a3dfcb17bfc030e5b2ce5e9faa53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7f4896d7b5398c7cbfd743",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "親しんだ銀の音色。\r\nだが、さらに高みを目指そう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88bfd2582a4cfde029e6935e371b3ec2551600e4519128606461aae821172094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a7be0c84025c7a1ec2fabe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっ、次こそは稀代の楽聖となろう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "303d75f9226218f0bd073e8c504a3b24844bed48c6972f0c1ba068dc08e01dee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7657c64ed51a83ef8e90cb50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "足りない！\r\nさらにエチュードを重ねなくては！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea51acdf072c0b419165e36d578f5b4c380daca36e88c02173755abb0f0df31a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7327db86550876a0e1538705",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くぅっ、ムジカに吞まれるとは…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d701351cd954051ea8f0ab60c8e836a09104c46a6c6cba2e1a4d7b58e2d46bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4482864f18500791284e3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、グラッツェ！グラッツェインフィニーテ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e01e9ddecfb9e1eee2b179f61e50ba11570f803c0b1c7a886a369f69b3a8c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4fa825cf2ce50103680ad1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっ、お気に召したかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a526a6fe22a91bbf5bd1d63f56c7b8576a7a74f79bfbb3fee22d2aba33733dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3681351e555a7b772bcb790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レッツ、セッション！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0257f7e263c4b502db1a1881ec52e89ad45e326b3a14b7d234476ab69d9bd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c746d7f22867ca5948a52b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "届け、メロディーーア！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9f038d6fb8db7619e9f5b4dcc966575f437a2dc67d504c05a4b9783b47a757",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:868f597b14ee88c433f55114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターボの存在がひとつの楽曲の\r\nようだ！ステージを往復ダッシュ…\r\nボーカルのお転婆はロックの花さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73747cbb4a75cbca8bf63c8485c12b98992dc331d4fca786d4ef7ec9530f6f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d43a5881048ef44928f6aca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感じるだろう。ヴァーゴ、パッショナート、\r\nラルゴ。そして湧き出る…アモォォォーーレ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ebb6fd6e84df1211dc6b249b1c21ef7d8ac5138ee2156d7386abcc202bd7ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2953306559211d33a4fc7753",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歓喜の調べ、その極致…皆に捧げてくるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56f147a6bae3c544cff3477764e5719a593f95240528c4ae526f6ea320057f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec8c85fe8701cae8a879f14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ムジカに乗せ、この高鳴りを解き放とう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2b08266055da780916ef9ca0b81f148267520fa658ecdd42e479dcab1f34ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda1ce23d0e0dd7914379b16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあコンチェルトを奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b88169a216f92f1852d724191fa9bfa87c21f112f80d6f28d3765a146fa6d50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e57c9b47d0b9da3ac0f53a78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忘れがたい、出会いの調べ。\r\nあの時の音色を思い出し、\r\n今でも愛しんでいるよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "787fd1e2e22c7a9a521090fa7670568cd0f659feb2f96ec24a19755473880297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d8b69fb7f1c92cf7aefefb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、馴染む…清らかな音色だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92d08c992a86df476a32b64a2894fc959d4fc31dd5321a8377a0636bfc9c8cb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:183754ed919f6c2742f80f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "音を纏う気分だ…ライブを感じるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b7a8acd3ba785d6ddbfb974fba8c0570e6ff301dc9db33fe2a9b6a306f3e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:130cbdb63587af1649c4df31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袖を通したからには、\r\nギアを上げて奏でるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e73c775e92778dfa8db4f424101f33d8ee52a7553f8eaacb2f7ae3668f39ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3fe978e963f66a3cb23dd4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スカートの折り目は美しく、が信条さ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e9447f63054e096be06e7740563c32d41e79d4e51264165d8012540e64c2e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14fca4fa370dd728cab4194d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌とダンスの協演…はぁ。\r\n早くあのステージに立ちたいよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaac27176b67cc84691b3884a1a82c456f47014eea1b3b128b372181e4ab235c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7713f4b1eb371d36daab2e69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装も演奏の醍醐味！\r\n心ゆくまで見てほしい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba76c70ce20b20702a0c153932853f954007041efe159a65709657ec0a2592c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4403f492f111664a056388d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お気に召したかい、アモーレ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a4c607d00fffbd9926f7951c2a3e37ae8b1bc0e55671a5f3fff8de7706f1ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7d4a57383271dafb149fd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなステージで着ようか…ふふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30f78f73ffa6b983fd422559f1112611deef4df68c03305b245c68f223e818c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02ca10fdf9fb7299933ff4fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、馴染む…清らかな音色だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92d08c992a86df476a32b64a2894fc959d4fc31dd5321a8377a0636bfc9c8cb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f83c642f3d34b3036497528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "音を纏う気分だ…ライブを感じるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b7a8acd3ba785d6ddbfb974fba8c0570e6ff301dc9db33fe2a9b6a306f3e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8f59034b64fc8cd4812fa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袖を通したからには、\r\nギアを上げて奏でるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e73c775e92778dfa8db4f424101f33d8ee52a7553f8eaacb2f7ae3668f39ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b531b8067688b886b4f54491",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スカートの折り目は美しく、が信条さ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e9447f63054e096be06e7740563c32d41e79d4e51264165d8012540e64c2e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa9e8608ac3e7df845d2e1c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌とダンスの協演…はぁ。\r\n早くあのステージに立ちたいよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaac27176b67cc84691b3884a1a82c456f47014eea1b3b128b372181e4ab235c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:584405ae4c0c22cdac667355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装も演奏の醍醐味！\r\n心ゆくまで見てほしい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba76c70ce20b20702a0c153932853f954007041efe159a65709657ec0a2592c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:670e1d8e8eec20e228fc094c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お気に召したかい、アモーレ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a4c607d00fffbd9926f7951c2a3e37ae8b1bc0e55671a5f3fff8de7706f1ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5273d092c5502509e8cd2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなステージで着ようか…ふふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30f78f73ffa6b983fd422559f1112611deef4df68c03305b245c68f223e818c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a874994387dfed02a239ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様",
      "source_fingerprint": "b953841c6237f6f93550f5268f577fd573201293558ed014b9eb53c636e0c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e0025132deceab42efedd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはよう、小鳥のさえずり――\r\nおはよう、営みのスオーノ！\r\n今日も世界は音楽に満ちているね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cd6bfbd8324f7ce79eb94804d7f372e1d6dab6855a0e8b39673ef5b0e3d7081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405efdfaac3fc15ec1a17096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体は起きても、心はおねむかな？\r\nそれじゃあ、耳元で囁いてあげる。\r\n目が覚めるような、愛の言葉をね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9d67018e69326413341cc63fc5403111002ca93792fcd68112172ee8ccf21c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e45a60d695a1d19e954b7de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "授業の終わり、それはエチュード\r\nの始まり。さあ、私たちも\r\nアパッシオナートな足音に続こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68449fcbd8ebea72895765503b931e56068c6b78836eeecd4578d77e46050fec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da4017879500a0ed5c378bad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後の食卓を彩った豆乳よ、\r\n次はいつ会えるんだい…？\r\n絹の調べが、もう恋しいよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "124f0d080ae1578a00dd7a6ffe7e8efa0f09c0fd77cfd9dd36268ea6ad13e7f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:302278282ace7d87d67e659d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必ず寝る前に尻尾をケアするのさ。\r\n私がエレガンテでいる限り、\r\n音は微笑んでくれるからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ece42821156e4cc12046a83599c08b15830ab4b0735ab747c33f641bca3d8a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274314b1ba13224739306ca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しーっ…今はカルマートに、ね？\r\n夜風に揺れる木々のコーロを、\r\nゆっくり楽しもうじゃないか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56977b539aa36620f48d944a4d37772d4072f880fd1e45debc8d3dbd3a300eb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfd884525e54da01f4827253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アスファルトを貫くツクシ、\r\nなんてディナミコな息吹なんだ。\r\n賛美の音色を奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a59af609cbd64f835dbde9a39d8ff52338d4e9bb0e6a79c025dd782ad2f9c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6acf499438017044fce4c4b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おっと、真夏の太陽かと思えば――\r\n君のパッショナートな瞳で、\r\n身も心も焼かれてしまいそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed36bc03563b5d0ecdacdeb2ba8c4ee65d1b329d5c3d201ac52b0c3ef55e2f49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616c6fb91ef8973e13f9d1f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は楽器の宝箱さ。\r\nさあ、落ち葉の道を行き、\r\nセッションとしゃれこもう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0097fd6e886526fb6b8de79dec07d0412e88ec371b5ad018430759d6d7a185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e83f6d50694b6784d4a758bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷たそうな君の手を放って\r\nおくなんて、私にはできないよ。\r\nおいで…温めてあげる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a593212c70129448a21c7d9a7e87a542baf251e51d9d57b9ad0180d29fe53b3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a9e5c7ab312dcc72df0b6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブオン・サン・バレンティーノ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc1e7888a46a7e643da26b24b27a6209a5130b57334e4d4cebdbc091fe94c4ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a687d4afaaee3c2830d771b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ソイヤソイヤ、ソイヤソイヤッ！！\r\nっと、これがキタサンの音色――\r\n速さの秘訣さ。モノにしたいね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f34bdbca89ba19cd06bba53609ecc4a92dd0d5a979db85d14a6696ba01de57e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfcc5891cacd9108a5e8399b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高尚总是远远地，\r\n害羞地听着我的演奏呢。\r\n呵呵，可爱得让人受不了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8239b28fff65599874207541f78e8eba10fc7676abb0998a076bd9655ab56abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd692d55e45d98a098882462",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダイヤとの散歩は心が躍る。\r\n変わった雑貨屋に怪しい路地…\r\nなんて愉快なノータとの出会い！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cba6aee68c645f9452914d24146fcb22c58c4dfac4e13d3a261203a454648c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4db44e8c4828d5be5df3877e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ…あああぁ～～！！\r\nお寿司、ワサビ抜きで頼んだのに！\r\nツーンが取れないよ、ツーンが！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68b4e91f6e3dd9483c22dbbba57ed96d6ae679f91ab4b0bc25516c0233ea49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
